00:15:25.020 --> 00:15:28.860
Time for me to turn up the heat!

00:15:31.740 --> 00:15:33.820
The tea's scalding hot!

00:15:33.820 --> 00:15:35.530
And the kotatsu's on high,

00:15:35.530 --> 00:15:36.870
with hot water bottles underneath!

00:15:37.740 --> 00:15:38.500
Turn it off-

00:15:39.200 --> 00:15:42.040
Hey, it's not THAT hot!

00:15:42.040 --> 00:15:43.750
Here, have some heating pads!

00:15:43.750 --> 00:15:47.210
Just tell Hitoha if you want the A/C on!

00:15:47.210 --> 00:15:49.510
The heat's fried her brain!

00:15:52.180 --> 00:15:54.930
The flavor is too weak, you didn't steep it right.

00:15:54.930 --> 00:15:56.760
She's critiquing it...

00:15:56.760 --> 00:15:59.020
That does it!

00:15:59.520 --> 00:16:01.350
Time for the space heater!

00:16:01.350 --> 00:16:02.270
Hey-

00:16:03.650 --> 00:16:04.730
Mitsuba!

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:11.490
D-Did you hurt yourself...?

00:16:11.490 --> 00:16:12.950
So nice...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.330
It's all cool and wet...

00:16:17.330 --> 00:16:20.620
I'm gonna marry this table...

00:16:21.540 --> 00:16:23.710
Hey, with all that sweat I bet you could

00:16:23.710 --> 00:16:25.710
pee your pants and we wouldn't even know!

00:16:25.710 --> 00:16:27.750
Good idea! I'm gonna let it all-

00:16:27.750 --> 00:16:30.460
Fine, I get it! I'll turn on the A/C!

00:16:30.460 --> 00:16:31.970
Yes!

00:16:31.970 --> 00:16:35.680
I'm gonna take this place back to the ice age!

00:16:35.680 --> 00:16:36.850
Huh?

00:16:36.850 --> 00:16:37.850
Dead batteries?

00:16:38.390 --> 00:16:39.970
Something's wrong...

00:16:44.980 --> 00:16:47.690
Your sweat fried the remote!

00:16:47.690 --> 00:16:49.940
Why does nothing go right when you're around?!

00:16:49.940 --> 00:16:51.610
I can't take it anymore!

00:16:51.610 --> 00:16:53.740
Let's go to my house and have some sweets

00:16:53.740 --> 00:16:55.530
in my nice cool bedroom!

00:16:55.530 --> 00:16:56.740
We're in!

00:16:56.740 --> 00:16:58.530
Wanna come, Mitsuba?

00:16:58.530 --> 00:16:59.910
As if I would!

00:17:04.500 --> 00:17:05.960
Sweets...

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:08.000
Bah!

00:17:08.000 --> 00:17:10.920
The remote's just a convenience!

00:17:10.920 --> 00:17:14.510
There are buttons right there on the wall unit!

00:17:14.510 --> 00:17:17.340
Bah, bah!

00:17:21.930 --> 00:17:23.680
We're divorced!

00:17:24.890 --> 00:17:27.850
Oh yeah... dad will never know.

00:17:35.780 --> 00:17:38.240
Now what should I-

00:17:38.240 --> 00:17:39.530
Oh yeah!

00:17:43.450 --> 00:17:45.660
She sure gave us a lot.

00:17:45.660 --> 00:17:47.330
Mitsuba will be glad!

00:17:47.330 --> 00:17:49.960
How many times do I have to tell you?

00:17:50.540 --> 00:17:51.880
Papa!

00:17:51.880 --> 00:17:52.800
Oh!

00:17:53.420 --> 00:17:57.050
I see, so Mitsuba broke the remote, huh?

00:17:57.050 --> 00:17:58.590
It wasn't on purpose.

00:17:58.590 --> 00:18:00.140
I know.

00:18:00.140 --> 00:18:03.770
Mitsuba knows to treat other people's property with respect-

00:18:04.560 --> 00:18:05.890
Dang it, dang it!

00:18:06.310 --> 00:18:09.230
Why?! Why won't you turn on?!

00:18:09.230 --> 00:18:10.270
Mitsuba.

00:18:11.400 --> 00:18:13.730
No air conditioning for a week.

00:18:16.650 --> 00:18:18.320
No sweets, either.

00:18:20.120 --> 00:18:22.910
Mitsudomoeeeee!

00:18:24.490 --> 00:18:26.910
Okay everyone, it's finally time for the pool...

00:18:26.910 --> 00:18:28.420
cleanup.

00:18:28.420 --> 00:18:29.120
Yay!

00:18:29.120 --> 00:18:30.460
You dumb virgin!

00:18:30.460 --> 00:18:33.090
Why does our class need to clean the stupid pool?!

00:18:33.090 --> 00:18:34.920
Because I lost at rock-paper-scissors!

00:18:34.920 --> 00:18:38.340
He's an outcast in the teacher's room,

00:18:38.340 --> 00:18:40.800
so he always ends up with all the annoying jobs.

00:18:40.800 --> 00:18:42.550
I don't need to hear that from you!

00:18:42.550 --> 00:18:45.390
I get treated like that because of all of <i>you</i>!

00:18:45.390 --> 00:18:47.390
So you admit you're an outcast.

00:18:52.940 --> 00:18:55.320
The pool floor's all slippery!

00:18:55.690 --> 00:18:57.490
Be careful, all right?

00:18:57.490 --> 00:18:58.360
See?

00:18:58.360 --> 00:19:00.070
If you just act like Futaba and pretend you're

00:19:00.070 --> 00:19:02.490
skating while you clean up, you'll be done in no time.

00:19:04.280 --> 00:19:06.200
We're going to the infirmary!

00:19:07.080 --> 00:19:08.750
Make sure you do a good job!

00:19:12.170 --> 00:19:13.840
It really is like skating!

00:19:13.840 --> 00:19:15.340
It's pretty fun!

00:19:16.420 --> 00:19:19.220
We'll let the dumb boys do all the work.

00:19:19.220 --> 00:19:21.840
Quit slacking off, you lazy cows!

00:19:21.840 --> 00:19:23.220
We're not babies.

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.060
We don't get all excited about fake-skating.

00:19:25.060 --> 00:19:27.470
You're just afraid you'll fall and bust your head,

00:19:27.470 --> 00:19:29.100
you nympho-klutz!

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:32.850
Shut up, you pervo-gorilla!

00:19:35.980 --> 00:19:37.360
That's it!

00:19:37.360 --> 00:19:39.190
To decide who cleans the pool,

00:19:39.190 --> 00:19:41.530
we'll have a boys vs. girls curling match!

00:19:41.530 --> 00:19:42.740
Curling?

00:19:42.740 --> 00:19:44.620
And we'll use people for the stones.

00:19:47.370 --> 00:19:50.500
We'll take turns sliding seven people down the pool,

00:19:50.500 --> 00:19:53.670
and whoever gets closest to the strip at the end of the line wins.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.670
Winner

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:53.670
Loser

00:19:53.960 --> 00:19:56.420
Fine, we're in.

00:19:56.420 --> 00:19:58.130
If the girls win,

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.550
you'll have to give me your pudding from your lunch tomorrow,

00:20:00.550 --> 00:20:02.340
address me as "Your Highness",

00:20:02.340 --> 00:20:04.510
be polite to me for the rest of your life,

00:20:04.510 --> 00:20:06.850
give me your pudding from your lunch tomorrow...

00:20:07.560 --> 00:20:09.680
She's just after pudding...

00:20:09.680 --> 00:20:11.940
The boys can go first.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:14.940
All right, rock-paper-scissors for the stone!

00:20:15.520 --> 00:20:16.690
Rock, paper...

00:20:18.230 --> 00:20:19.820
Dang it...

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:23.360
Satou looks so hot while he's sliding!

00:20:23.360 --> 00:20:25.030
So embarrassing...

00:20:26.990 --> 00:20:29.450
Sweet, he got to a nice spot!

00:20:30.040 --> 00:20:31.580
Your turn.

00:20:31.580 --> 00:20:33.080
Who's going first?

00:20:33.080 --> 00:20:34.420
First?

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:40.090
I'm sorry...

00:20:40.090 --> 00:20:41.840
Oh, it's okay.

00:20:41.840 --> 00:20:43.380
It <i>is</i> okay, huh?

00:20:43.380 --> 00:20:44.220
Yeah.

00:20:47.050 --> 00:20:48.430
Mememememememememememe-

00:20:48.430 --> 00:20:50.060
Denied! Denied!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:52.810
I think we should use our heaviest stone first.

00:20:52.810 --> 00:20:53.600
Huh?

00:20:56.650 --> 00:20:58.360
It <i>was</i> her idea.

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:05.030
She's gonna blow me away!

00:21:10.910 --> 00:21:13.200
T-Too heavy...

00:21:13.200 --> 00:21:15.710
Okay, it's our turn next!

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.680
The fat pig's blocking us!

00:21:29.680 --> 00:21:31.930
At this rate the boys will win!

00:21:31.930 --> 00:21:33.930
We've gotta move her...

00:21:34.520 --> 00:21:36.350
Mitsuba, turn this way!

00:21:37.190 --> 00:21:38.690
This is our only chance...

00:21:38.690 --> 00:21:41.570
Push me with all your might!

00:21:42.360 --> 00:21:43.320
Are you sure?

00:21:57.120 --> 00:21:59.580
The combination of Mitsuba's flab...

00:21:59.580 --> 00:22:02.050
...and Hitoha's soft cheeks!

00:22:05.050 --> 00:22:06.220
We did it!

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:07.130
Right on the line!

00:22:07.130 --> 00:22:08.510
The girls win!

00:22:10.220 --> 00:22:12.760
Everyone, are you done with the cleaning?

00:22:19.730 --> 00:22:23.020
I'll just do it myself, just get out!

00:22:23.020 --> 00:22:25.030
He snapped.

00:23:56.050 --> 00:23:58.350
Finally, it's the last episode of Mitsudomoe Zouryouchuu!

00:23:58.350 --> 00:24:00.760
Sit tight until next week, okay?

00:24:00.760 --> 00:24:02.830
We've gotta do something special

00:24:02.830 --> 00:24:04.930
for all the fans who supported our show!

00:24:04.580 --> 00:24:10.080
These Three Girls Will Keep Going, On and On

00:24:04.930 --> 00:24:06.630
So, let's do this last one together.

00:24:06.630 --> 00:24:07.920
One, two...

00:24:07.920 --> 00:24:09.500
See you next time!
